# GenImage MCP Skill

**Server:** genimage  
**URL:** https://mcp.baisoln.com/genimage/mcp  
**Transport:** HTTP

## When to use

- Generating images from text prompts (AI image generation)
- Using Runware API for image creation or editing
- Any "generate an image" or "create image from prompt" task

## Usage

Reference this skill with `@mcp-skills/genimage` when you need AI-generated images. For BMAD workflows (e.g. wireframes, diagrams), also use @bmad/integrations/genimage. Use exact tool names from the MCP server.

## Notes

- Remote access via Kong proxy; tool names are defined by the server.
- Verify tool names and parameters before deploying; wrong names cause silent failures.
